IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SCREENJOB.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY ACCESSAREA.
01 RECORD-DECISION PIC X(4).
01 SCREEN-STATUS PIC X(4).
01 NEXT-SCREEN PIC X(8).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-REQUEST-ID PIC X(12).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING INPUT-REQUEST-ID.
COPY SCREENCTL.

1000-INITIALISE SECTION.
    MOVE SPACES TO ACCESS-AREA RECORD-DECISION NEXT-SCREEN.
    MOVE INPUT-REQUEST-ID TO REQUEST-ID.
    MOVE 'OK' TO SCREEN-STATUS.

2000-FETCH-REQUEST SECTION.
    MOVE 'GET' TO ACCESS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'DATAACCESS' USING ACCESS-AREA
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 'FAIL' TO ACCESS-STATUS
    END-CALL.

2500-VALIDATE SECTION.
    IF REQUEST-STATE = 'PENDING'
        MOVE 'OK' TO RECORD-DECISION
    ELSE
        MOVE 'SKIP' TO RECORD-DECISION
    END-IF.

3000-SAVE SECTION.
    MOVE 'DONE' TO TARGET-STATE.
    MOVE 'SAVE' TO ACCESS-FUNCTION.
    CALL 'DATAACCESS' USING ACCESS-AREA
        ON EXCEPTION
            MOVE 'FAIL' TO ACCESS-STATUS
    END-CALL.
    IF ACCESS-STATUS NOT = 'OK'
        MOVE 'IOER' TO SCREEN-STATUS
    END-IF.

4000-NEXT-SCREEN SECTION.
    IF SCREEN-STATUS = 'OK'
        IF RECORD-DECISION = 'OK'
            MOVE 'CONFIRM' TO NEXT-SCREEN
        ELSE
            MOVE 'REVIEW' TO NEXT-SCREEN
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'ERROR' TO NEXT-SCREEN
    END-IF.
